sequenceDiagram
  participant G as Gate G1 (ANPR)
  participant FC as Forward chainer
  participant CL as Control layer
  participant B as Bays
  participant MN as Monitor (phase 2)
  G->>FC: arrival(V,T), anpr(V,P)
  FC->>FC: saturate phase 1 (strata 0–2)
  FC->>CL: admitted, candidate, cost, priority
  loop each minute event
    CL->>B: release departures first
    CL->>CL: order arrivals by priority 0–5, then time
    CL->>B: cheapest free candidate bay (cost, then id)
    alt no free bay
      CL->>CL: put in waiting queue, retry on next departure
    end
  end
  CL->>MN: assigned(V,B)
  MN->>MN: saturate phase 2 rules w1–w14
  MN-->>G: alerts, tow requests, ward notices
